{
  "_comment": [
    "Runs the traffic light AND payload capture at the same time.",
    "",
    "Install: cp tools/hook-settings.debug.json .claude/settings.json",
    "         then restart Claude Code.",
    "",
    "Why: PermissionRequest fires on every permission *evaluation*, not",
    "only when a human is prompted, so mapping it to WAITING turns the",
    "light red during ordinary tool calls. We need payloads from both an",
    "auto-approved call and a real human prompt to find a field that",
    "tells them apart.",
    "",
    "Capture writes to capture/raw.jsonl (gitignored). Revert to",
    "tools/hook-settings.example.json when done."
  ],
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "/Users/aayushkedawat/bin/traffic-light-hook",
            "args": [
              "-hook",
              "SessionStart"
            ],
            "async": true,
            "timeout": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "/Users/aayushkedawat/Downloads/Projects/traffic-lights/tools/capture/capture-hook.sh",
            "args": [
              "SessionStart"
            ],
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "/Users/aayushkedawat/bin/traffic-light-hook",
            "args": [
              "-hook",
              "UserPromptSubmit"
            ],
            "async": true,
            "timeout": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "/Users/aayushkedawat/Downloads/Projects/traffic-lights/tools/capture/capture-hook.sh",
            "args": [
              "UserPromptSubmit"
            ],
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PermissionRequest": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "/Users/aayushkedawat/bin/traffic-light-hook",
            "args": [
              "-hook",
              "PermissionRequest"
            ],
            "async": true,
            "timeout": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "/Users/aayushkedawat/Downloads/Projects/traffic-lights/tools/capture/capture-hook.sh",
